[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS requires comprehensive maintenance procedures for software updates, hardware maintenance, and operational support for military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for maintenance procedures.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers maintenance organization, referenced documents, maintenance procedures, and support arrangements per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports effective maintenance.
[[/SECTION]]
[[/SECTION]]
