[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 3. Maintenance organization
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-003-MILUAV
TITLE: Maintenance Organization
STATEMENT: Maintenance organization includes maintenance manager, software engineers, hardware technicians, and support personnel with defined roles and responsibilities.
RATIONALE: Maintenance organization ensures effective system maintenance.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-004-MILUAV
TITLE: Maintenance Levels
STATEMENT: Maintenance levels include organizational maintenance, intermediate maintenance, and depot maintenance with escalation procedures for military systems.
RATIONALE: Maintenance levels ensure appropriate maintenance support.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-005-MILUAV
TITLE: Maintenance Authority
STATEMENT: Maintenance authority includes change approval authority, release authority, and deployment authority for military software maintenance.
RATIONALE: Maintenance authority ensures controlled system evolution.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 4. Maintenance procedures
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-006-MILUAV
TITLE: Preventive Maintenance
STATEMENT: Preventive maintenance includes software updates, hardware inspections, performance monitoring, and system optimization for military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: Preventive maintenance ensures system reliability and performance.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-007-MILUAV
TITLE: Corrective Maintenance
STATEMENT: Corrective maintenance includes defect correction, bug fixes, performance improvements, and security patches for military software systems.
RATIONALE: Corrective maintenance ensures system functionality and security.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-008-MILUAV
TITLE: Adaptive Maintenance
STATEMENT: Adaptive maintenance includes requirement changes, interface updates, and system enhancements for evolving military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: Adaptive maintenance ensures system adaptability and effectiveness.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-009-MILUAV
TITLE: Perfective Maintenance
STATEMENT: Perfective maintenance includes performance optimization, code refactoring, and system improvements for military software systems.
RATIONALE: Perfective maintenance ensures system efficiency and maintainability.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 5. Change management
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-010-MILUAV
TITLE: Change Request Process
STATEMENT: Change request process includes change identification, impact analysis, approval procedures, and implementation tracking for military software maintenance.
RATIONALE: Change request process ensures controlled system evolution.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-011-MILUAV
TITLE: Version Management
STATEMENT: Version management includes software versions, hardware versions, and documentation versions with release management and deployment tracking.
RATIONALE: Version management ensures system traceability and reliability.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-012-MILUAV
TITLE: Release Management
STATEMENT: Release management includes release planning, testing, deployment, and rollback procedures for military software releases.
RATIONALE: Release management ensures safe and reliable system updates.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 6. Support arrangements
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-013-MILUAV
TITLE: Technical Support
STATEMENT: Technical support includes help desk services, remote diagnostics, on-site support, and technical documentation for military operations.
RATIONALE: Technical support ensures system reliability and availability.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-014-MILUAV
TITLE: Training Support
STATEMENT: Training support includes operator training, maintenance training, and update training for military personnel and contractors.
RATIONALE: Training support ensures competent system operation and maintenance.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-015-MILUAV
TITLE: Documentation Support
STATEMENT: Documentation support includes maintenance procedures, troubleshooting guides, and technical documentation for military software systems.
RATIONALE: Documentation support ensures effective system maintenance and operation.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 7. Notes
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SMM-016-MILUAV
TITLE: Maintenance Security
STATEMENT: Maintenance procedures shall include security controls, access controls, and audit trails for military software maintenance and updates.
RATIONALE: Maintenance security ensures system protection and compliance.
[[/SECTION]]

